age","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただmRNAのやつは徐々に成分が作られるから。","ts":"1630488998.172300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6rYC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fa53533-b3bd-412f-a357-bec50bed55f8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"免疫の反応(←この定義次第だけども)そのものはあっという間に起こるんだよな。それこそ15分くらい。","ts":"1630488975.171800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J=/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"645bbeb3-fb89-4d50-892f-5c88c302d053","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、そうですね、初回でいきなりじゃないし、覚える系細胞がまわる時間も必要だろうし","ts":"1630488969.171600","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1630488977.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vaO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be1e8be3-7753-4e8a-a42f-46153cc84b45","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"少なくとも免疫における有効な記憶の形成に時間と回数が要るよね、って話だとは思う。","ts":"1630488929.170600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EWr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0de5128-6cb3-49e9-b29c-3ac1659cb818","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うーん、もっと知らんとですね","ts":"1630488905.170100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xrz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66078d2d-49dd-42a7-be46-33dcd100660d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"さすがにちょっとちがうのかな?、詳しくはないので憶測です...","ts":"1630488888.169700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RdwCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa858eaa-4b44-428f-8850-a64b8f5874d6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーんどうかなぁ","ts":"1630488860.169100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5IUs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e945d30-c427-4bc5-b1d7-aea93106f63c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33B